# Migration checksums (src/persistence/postgres/migrate.ts) are the sha256 of
# the raw bytes of each .sql file and are recorded in `schema_migrations` on
# first apply. With core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout rewrites those files
# to CRLF, so the same commit hashes differently per worktree and every
# already-migrated database reports checksum drift. Pin SQL to LF so the
# checksum of a given commit is the same on every machine and worktree.
*.sql text eol=lf
